  "details": "Repro steps:\n1. Add a variable with type `Animation[]`\n2. click `>` of the entry to show details\n3. Click `Edit`. set size text to `1` and press `Enter`\n4. Then ArgumentException occurs\n5. also, Click `Save`. Then NullReferenceException occurs\n--- Details\nProblem exists in UdonArrayInspector.cs.\n`UdonArrayInspector<T>.GetValueField()` returns null if unsupported type. Caller use that null value `_container.Add(field as VisualElement)`.\nVersion: VRCSDK-UDON-2020.06.18.16.59_Closed_Community_Test",
